vendor/

# GSM source is private, so Pages cannot fetch it at build time. Research
# and schema publication copies are refreshed locally with
# scripts/sync-gsm-content.sh and checked in with the documentation changes.

# Normative spec prose and PlantUML live only in gsm-specifications.
# Do not check in copies; remaining pages link to that repo.
gsm/specifications/specification.md
gsm/specifications/conformance.md
gsm/specifications/model/gsm.puml
gsm/specifications/model/gsm-ascription-lifecycle.puml
